OL,3,GNEWSA'Never any suggestion' of closing
OL,4,Alocal hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health trust has said there was
OL,7,F"never any suggestion" of a community
OL,8,Fhospital closing despite fears it was
OL,9,Fbeing downgraded.
OL,11,FAs part of a trial, a dedicated complex
OL,12,Fcare unit has been set up at
OL,13,FCirencester Hospital in Gloucestershire
OL,14,Fto provide rehabilitative care to
OL,15,Fpatients with complex needs. This has
OL,16,Freduced the number of beds on site, and
OL,17,Fseen some services moved to other
OL,18,Fclinics.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
