OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1795069607
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Never any suggestion' of closing
OL,4,Alocal hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire Health and Care Trust
OL,7,F(GHC) said the aim of the trial is to
OL,8,Fensure patients receive the most
OL,9,Fappropriate care and return home
OL,10,Fquicker.
OL,12,FChief executive Douglas Blair told
OL,13,FGloucestershire County Council's Health
OL,14,Fand Overview Scrutiny Committee the
OL,15,Fchanges were to improve treatment.
